{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A simulation RPG set in modern Japan!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is modern Japan, Kanagawa Prefecture. The characters are all normal, life-sized students and working adults.\u00a0 A simulation RPG with a unique world view, where you fight with bikes and fists instead of swords and magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/9efa62c5b054a1356a5645c84ad51109.poster.avif?t=1769095183\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/9efa62c5b054a1356a5645c84ad51109.webm?t=1769095183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/9efa62c5b054a1356a5645c84ad51109.mp4?t=1769095183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simultaneous turn-based battles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game employs a &quot;simultaneous turn-based&quot; system in which the order of enemy and ally actions is jumbled. This is a new type of strategy that tests both impulsive decision-making and long-term strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also change the order in which your allies act using the special command &quot;Shift Change.&quot; If you master this, you can completely change the course of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/59fa33dc3915bbc07d384d50b29cf218.poster.avif?t=1769095183\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/59fa33dc3915bbc07d384d50b29cf218.webm?t=1769095183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/59fa33dc3915bbc07d384d50b29cf218.mp4?t=1769095183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A large number of unique characters appear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many characters with various skills and unique actions appear!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your favorite character, utilize their individuality, and defeat powerful enemies!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*31 characters will be playable in the early access version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/5cc5084482f0dc735e8ff37e304d1401.avif?t=1769095183\" width=600 height=360 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A profound scenario consisting of three parts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A three-part story depicting the fierce battle that took place over three years at Gyoun High School.\u00a0 Please enjoy this intense, momentary, and passionate drama about boys and girls.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The early access version includes the scenario of &quot;Part 1: Murakumo Alliance&quot; and &quot;Part 2: Blue Octave&quot;, which is 2/3 of the total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/extras/dafaca74200cb4f5fd925b7c472511e5.avif?t=1769095183\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by &quot;CRIWARE&quot;.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2309730/b44c25478d25fc373ad9be81308e1a8c58bb3a01.jpg"},{"name":"Enemies to Defeat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2309730/f1c3901045cd61d2804fefd731486ff72c0e5a0f.jpg"},{"name":"Assault","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2309730/36299ebdc5ae4f9b683c92b51985250af28689b3.jpg"},{"name":"Murakumo Alliance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2309730/d92b08c3cde0aba4f34f3eb710eb79360a8770f9.jpg"},{"name":"Dojo Guidance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2309730/85e0b32c38b7eb253da98a448bf8506c5c7d6d9f.jpg"},{"name":"Three Stars!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2309730/3acb63187e9c513d4b863a6ca8a2536b92fb6686.jpg"},{"name":"Move Out!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2309730/ff294551932b4f58802388958f099b6757f4726d.jpg"},{"name":"Alliance's activity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2309730/751f85d237ce99a6507b6ce3c53350f7e7cb1a35.jpg"},{"name":"Enlightenment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2309730/97e84c74ee552651b6ea4058e54ef38b5fa750a6.jpg"},{"name":"Limited to actual item","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2309730/ac2e005bbecb21806c8ab74a7fb0bdeb5f760e00.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2309730?t=1769095183","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2309730?t=1769095183","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/23f3fb16026e6a85c6d41fb61efe0b633c3f6500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769095183","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309730/23f3fb16026e6a85c6d41fb61efe0b633c3f6500/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769095183","categories":[{"description":"S